---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy | iThrive" heading="Privacy policy" description="How the iThrive Infusion & Wellness website handles information.">
  <p>This policy explains how {site.legalName} ("iThrive", "we") handles information when you visit this website. Our separate Notice of Privacy Practices explains how we use and protect your health information as a patient.</p>
  <h2>Information this website collects</h2>
  <p>This website does not ask you to create an account. Like most websites, our hosting provider may automatically record basic technical information, such as your IP address, browser type and the pages you visit, to keep the site secure and working.</p>
  <h2>Chat assistant</h2>
  <p>Our website chat is an automated AI assistant, not a medical provider, and it does not give medical advice. To answer your questions, the messages you type are sent to our AI provider, Anthropic, which processes them under its own terms. We do not use the chat to collect health information, so please do not share personal health details, dates of birth or insurance information in it. Your conversation is kept in your browser only until you close the tab.</p>
  <p>If you use "Call me back", we collect only your name, phone number, best time to call and a general topic. It is sent to our clinic by email through a form delivery service so we can return your call, and we use it only for that purpose.</p>
  <h2>Booking and the patient portal</h2>
  <p>When you book an appointment or log in to the patient portal, you leave this website and use a system run by our practice management provider. Information you enter there is handled under our Notice of Privacy Practices and that provider's terms.</p>
  <h2>Maps and third-party links</h2>
  <p>Our contact pages include an embedded Google Map. Google may collect information when you interact with it under its own privacy policy. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of websites we link to.</p>
  <h2>Text messages and calls</h2>
  <p>If you text or call us, we use your phone number only to respond to you and manage your care. Please do not send detailed health information by text. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Call {site.phone} or write to us at {site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.state} {site.address.zip}.</p>
</Legal>
